      <activity id="7377a5c2-a14b-5ca3-9385-037641150f52" activityNameId="a23a11f0-769c-5c6c-924a-115e813fa428" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Hard coal briquettes, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Hard coal briquettes, at plant
Low heating value is 31.4 MJ/kg. Bulk density is 780 kg/m3. Only emission data on particles were available for the production process. The emissions of trace elements are assumed to be proportional to their relevant content in the input coal.;
UUID: 2d6a2082-2a3f-3676-8ea3-b632165eee1e
The process considered is brick making using bitumen as binder, at a temperature below 100°C. The module includes energy input, transport of the coal and emissions to air.
Location: German conditions.
Technology: No specific information available.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature 
Extrapolations: see Geography/Text
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_2d6a2082-2a3f-3676-8ea3-b632165eee1e.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
